SUMMARY:Cupcake & Bubbles
DESCRIPTION:🧁🥂 Cupcake & Bubbles at the Vineyard 🥂🧁\n📅 Sunday\, May 10 | 12–3pm\nCelebrate Mom with a sparkling afternoon of sweetness\, sunshine\, and vineyard charm. 🌿✨\nTreat the special women in your life to a relaxing experience featuring your choice of a glass of handcrafted sparkling wine or a refreshing mimosa\, perfectly paired with a delicious cupcake. It’s the sweetest way to slow down\, savor the moment\, and celebrate together.\n🎟 Ticket Includes:\n🥂 Glass of Sparkling Wine or Mimosa\n🧁 Cupcake\nSurrounded by sunlit vines and springtime blooms\, raise a glass to the women who do it all—mothers\, grandmothers\, daughters\, and dear friends. 💐\n✨ Join us as we toast to love\, gratitude\, and the joy of celebrating Mom in style.\n🍽 Please Note: No outside food allowed on Mother’s Day.\nCheese\, salami\, crackers\, and snacks will also be available for purchase.\n💕 Make this Mother’s Day extra sweet at the vineyard!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/cupcake-bubbles/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
